CeladonCity_Text_FatMan::
	.string "This POLIWRATH is my partner.\p"
	.string "I wonder if it’ll ever evolve into a\n"
	.string "frog POKéMON.$"

CeladonCity_Text_Poliwrath::
	.string "POLIWRATH: Croak!$"

CeladonCity_Text_Woman2::
	.string "CELADON DEPT.STORE has the biggest\n"
	.string "and best selection of merchandise.\p"
	.string "If you can’t get it here, you\n"
	.string "can’t get it anywhere.\l"
	.string "Gee... I sound like a sales clerk.$"

CeladonCity_Text_Lass::
	.string "Looking at the ground while I was\n"
	.string "walking made me dizzy.$"

CeladonCity_Text_Beauty::
	.string "I lost at the slot machines again...\p"
	.string "We girls also play the slots now.\p"
	.string "You should check them out too.$"

CeladonCity_Text_OldMan2::
	.string "GRIMER have been appearing lately.\p"
	.string "See that pond out in front of the\n"
	.string "house? GRIMER live there now.\p"
	.string "Where did they come from? This is\n"
	.string "a serious problem...$"

CeladonCity_Text_Man::
	.string "They’re holding an eating contest at\n"
	.string "the restaurant.\p"
	.string "Just watching them go at it makes me\n"
	.string "feel bloated...$"

CeladonCity_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "Nihihi! This GYM is great!\n"
	.string "Only girls are allowed here!$"

CeladonCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "Want to know a secret?\p"
	.string "CELADON MANSION has a hidden back\n"
	.string "door.$"

CeladonCity_Text_Trigger5_1::
	.string "ARD: Huh?!$"

CeladonCity_Text_Trigger5_2::
	.string "ARD: Lookey here!\n"
	.string "It’s the big loser!\p"
	.string "Haha! What are you doing?\p"
	.string "Don’t tell me you want to battle\n"
	.string "against this GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "But you’ll struggle if you don’t own\n"
	.string "a BUG POKéMON.\p"
	.string "That means, of course, this battle\n"
	.string "was a piece of cake for me, haha!\p"
	.string "If I keep this rhythm I will be\n"
	.string "CHAMPION in no time!\p"
	.string "Oh, yeah. But first I need to take\n"
	.string "care of you!$"

CeladonCity_Text_Trigger5Defeat::
	.string "Grrr...$"

CeladonCity_Text_Trigger5Victory::
	.string "Haha! I’m ready to become the\n"
	.string "CHAMPION!$"

CeladonCity_Text_Trigger5_3::
	.string "ARD: You may have defeated my BUG\n"
	.string "POKéMON this time.\p"
	.string "But still I’ll become the CHAMPION,\n"
	.string "and then I’ll battle you to show\l"
	.string "everyone that BUG POKéMON are the\l"
	.string "really best!\p"
	.string "I’m going, BAD luck, loser!\n"
	.string "Hahaha!$"

